==English==

===Suffix===
{{head|en}}

# {{context|urban|_|slang|lang=en}} Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking the plural of nouns. Usually used in words in which the [[-s]] suffix is actually pronounced "z".
#: '''''Boyz''' are always trouble.''
# {{context|urban|_|slang|lang=en}} Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking verb inflections.
#: ''He '''lovez''' me.''

===See also===
* [[-a]]

